{"id":2149,"level":79,"name":"Захист (1)","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>&ldquo;The attack is the best defense&rdquo;. Unfortunately, this wisdom does not always hold up in chess. If the opponent is aiming all their arrows at your king, you are forced into a defensive role. The art of good defense is to know how to parry all the opponent's threats.&nbsp;</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Sometimes it is a matter of &ldquo;surviving,&rdquo; after which you can win on the basis of positional or material advantages.&nbsp;</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?&nbsp;</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Parry the opponent's threats.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"5r1k/2p3p1/p1p3Qp/3p4/2P2q2/7P/PrB3P1/6RK b - - 0 34","pgn":"34... Rxc2 * ","text":"<p>Біла батарея загрожує матом на h7. Найкращий захист —<strong> 1...Rxc2!</strong> Це коштує розміну, але чорні все ще мають матеріальну перевагу після цієї торгівлі.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"2kr1b1r/ppp1nppp/3p4/1P2p3/Nq2P3/3Q1N2/P1P2PPP/R1B1K2R w KQ - 0 13","pgn":"{[#]} 13. Nc3 {[%csl Rb4,Gc3,Ge1]} * ","text":"<p>Чорні мають подвійний напад. На щастя, це не проблема, тому що з <strong>1.Nc3!</strong> у білих все ще під контролем.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"4r1k1/p4pb1/5Q1p/7P/6R1/2p3P1/2q2PK1/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... Qh7 {[%csl Rf6,Rg4,Gg7,Gg8,Gh7]} * ","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":78625,"fen":"1r3r2/1p2pp1k/p2p1npb/8/2P1PPqp/1PN5/PB1Q2BK/2RR4 w - - 0 21","pgn":"{[%csl Rg4,Rh4,Rh6][%evp 0,1,176,153]} {Q=2} 21. Ne2 {P=1}  * ","format":27,"texts":["Була загроза як небезпечної атаки f4, так і ...Qg3+ з наступним ...h4-h3. Небезпека минула.","Чорні загрожують дратуючим шахом g3, а пішак f також висить."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80267,"fen":"2rqr2k/pp4pp/8/8/3bN1P1/5P1P/PP3QB1/1RB3K1 w - - 0 28","pgn":"{[%csl Gc1][%evp 0,1,238,236]} 28. Be3 * ","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78628,"fen":"r1b1kb1r/pp2pppp/n2p1n2/1N6/2PBP3/5N2/Pq3PPP/R2Q1RK1 b kq - 0 12","pgn":"{[%csl Rb5,Rd4][%evp 0,1,-248,-246]} {Q=2} 12... Qb4 {P=1} * ","format":27,"texts":["This is the only accessible escape square.","Bring your queen back to safety."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78636,"fen":"2kr2r1/1p5p/p1p5/Q2p4/5q1P/1P1P1b2/1PP2R2/1K3R2 b - - 0 32","pgn":"{[%csl Rf1,Rf2][%evp 0,1,-318,-297]} {Q=2} 32... Rg3  {P=1} * ","format":27,"texts":["Thus, Black keeps the material edge.","Збережіть свого слона."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78632,"fen":"1k1r3r/p1p3b1/B2p2pp/3Qp3/3nPp2/1PN2Pnq/PB6/2KR2R1 b - - 0 21","pgn":"{[%csl Ra6,Rd5][%evp 0,1,-296,-266]} {Q=2} 21... c6 {P=1}  * ","format":27,"texts":["The only way to deliver mate without losing material.","Захищайтеся від загрози напарника, не втрачаючи матеріалів."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80272,"fen":"rn3bkr/ppq1p1pp/2p2n2/6N1/3p4/1Q6/PPP2PPP/R1B1K2R b KQ - 0 11","pgn":"{[%csl Gf6][%evp 0,1,-336,-336]} 11... Nd5 * ","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78947,"fen":"5Q2/7k/8/r5Kp/2B1bP2/4p1P1/4Pn2/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ra5][%evp 0,1,519,982]} 1. Kh4 * ","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80274,"fen":"r1bq1r2/ppp1n1k1/3pN1pp/3Pp2n/4B3/N1P3PP/PP1Q1P2/R3K2R b KQ - 0 16","pgn":"{[%csl Re6]} 16... Bxe6 * ","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80257,"fen":"r1b1r1k1/1p3p1p/pqn5/5B1Q/8/1N3P2/P1P3PP/R2K3R b - - 0 19","pgn":"{[%csl Rf5]} 19... Bxf5 * ","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78640,"fen":"r3r1k1/pp5p/1q1pbQpB/2nB4/2P5/1P4P1/P3PP1P/5RK1 b - - 0 20","pgn":"{[%csl Rf6,Rh6][%evp 0,1,-199,-200]} {Q=2} 20... Qc7 {P=1}  * ","format":27,"texts":["Black defends against mate and keeps the material edge.","Захистіть себе від загрози партнера."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78948,"fen":"r